00:01:36.734 --> 00:01:37.675
- Ducks.

00:01:37.675 --> 00:01:38.433
- Duck.

00:01:38.433 --> 00:01:39.072
- Ducks.

00:01:39.072 --> 00:01:39.699
- Duck.

00:01:39.699 --> 00:01:40.314
- Duck.

00:01:40.314 --> 00:01:42.019
