00:02:12.334 --> 00:02:13.774
I don't get that one.

00:02:13.774 --> 00:02:15.655
She has webbed feet, okay a duck.

00:02:15.655 --> 00:02:17.873
Only crumbs are left, feeding the ducks.

00:02:17.873 --> 00:02:19.393
The kids were swimming in a pond.

00:02:19.393 --> 00:02:22.610
The sun is hot at the pond
